WEBVTT

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:44.587
This isn't the sound of the end.

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:48.924
It's the sound of the next battle starting.

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:12.698
<i>This is me. My hair streams across...</i>

00:01:12.907 --> 00:01:17.286
<i>...my cheeks dyed red</i>

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:21.457
<i>I am me... A grain of determination</i>

00:01:21.665 --> 00:01:26.212
<i>That was how it began</i>

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:36.847
<i>If there is a tomorrow that is not
hazed over by hope or despair,</i>

00:01:37.056 --> 00:01:38.224
<i>(simple as that)</i>

00:01:38.432 --> 00:01:40.726
<i>I will not forget</i>

00:01:40.935 --> 00:01:46.273
<i>This pain is the promise we made that day</i>

00:01:46.482 --> 00:01:49.276
<i>I want to make it come true, I can't, I will</i>

00:01:49.485 --> 00:01:56.242
<i>At night I grab the void and awaken
to something in the morning</i>

00:01:56.450 --> 00:02:06.210
<i>I merely soar into the endless sky,
taking the shackles called "reason" Yes,</i>

00:02:06.418 --> 00:02:10.172
<i>"That is all.</i> "

00:02:25.896 --> 00:02:27.731
So that is...

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:35.406
...our god...

00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:49.795
Were you able to get a good look

00:02:50.004 --> 00:02:52.006
at our triumph,

00:02:52.214 --> 00:02:54.758
Tempest Hoof Fecor?

00:02:58.095 --> 00:03:00.472
Now, let us go.

00:03:03.642 --> 00:03:06.478
To see our god
declare his Grand Order.

00:03:11.483 --> 00:03:13.485
Raise your head, and behold.

00:03:16.822 --> 00:03:18.240
I am divine,

00:03:18.449 --> 00:03:21.243
beyond your comprehension.

00:03:21.452 --> 00:03:25.205
Let your joy burn like fire.

00:03:25.414 --> 00:03:27.833
Quiet your terror.

00:03:29.126 --> 00:03:30.836
You, who walk beside me,

00:03:31.045 --> 00:03:33.172
the time has come.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:37.926
My heart is renewed,
and my power restored.

00:03:39.053 --> 00:03:42.264
I now declare the
Grand Order's final stage.

00:03:43.307 --> 00:03:46.310
Creation's second coming,
once halted,

00:03:46.518 --> 00:03:49.313
and a still greater deed.

00:03:49.521 --> 00:03:51.774
That is...

00:03:51.982 --> 00:03:55.319
In the rift between worlds,
I shall create a copy of this one...

00:03:55.527 --> 00:03:57.446
Xanadu!

00:04:01.492 --> 00:04:03.160
Xanadu?

00:04:03.369 --> 00:04:06.955
It will be the manifestation of your desires.

00:04:07.164 --> 00:04:13.545
It will exist for you,
and it will welcome you.

00:04:13.754 --> 00:04:15.839
Those of you who
are older may know this...

00:04:16.048 --> 00:04:18.509
Millennia ago,

00:04:18.717 --> 00:04:21.220
I attempted this creation.

00:04:21.428 --> 00:04:24.640
But I was sent to
the rift between worlds

00:04:24.848 --> 00:04:28.227
by the secret treasure
of the slayers I'd invited.

00:04:29.311 --> 00:04:30.270
However,

00:04:30.479 --> 00:04:33.899
I realized as I wandered

00:04:34.108 --> 00:04:38.779
where this new
creation should be made.

00:04:38.987 --> 00:04:40.531
That is,

00:04:40.739 --> 00:04:44.284
in the very rift
where I was banished.

00:04:44.952 --> 00:04:45.869
And also,

00:04:46.078 --> 00:04:51.250
I saw how this new
creation should be performed!

00:04:51.458 --> 00:04:52.501
That is,

00:04:52.709 --> 00:04:56.338
not sealed away,
in a small corner of this world.

00:04:56.547 --> 00:04:59.425
Rather, I shall recreate
all creation itself.

00:04:59.633 --> 00:05:03.846
That is Xanadu,
a complete copy of this world.

00:05:04.054 --> 00:05:06.140
It will mimic this world,

00:05:06.348 --> 00:05:08.892
and it will bear life...

00:05:09.101 --> 00:05:11.395
A complete world!

00:05:11.603 --> 00:05:17.443
A paradise for you, with Power
of Existence coming forth endlessly.

00:05:17.651 --> 00:05:20.028
After these thousands of years,

00:05:20.237 --> 00:05:24.199
I shall again attempt a Grand Order
of creation, at your behest!

00:05:24.408 --> 00:05:26.827
So I may answer your prayers,

00:05:27.035 --> 00:05:29.746
as your Creator God!

00:05:42.634 --> 00:05:45.679
"Declaration of the Grand Order"

00:05:49.057 --> 00:05:52.603
Hey, Balar, what did he just say?

00:05:52.811 --> 00:05:56.398
He'll make another world between
the Crimson World and the human one.

00:05:56.607 --> 00:06:00.194
A perfect world for Denizens.

00:06:00.903 --> 00:06:02.696
That is wrong, indeed.

00:06:02.905 --> 00:06:04.531
Focus now.

00:06:05.616 --> 00:06:07.534
That declaration...

00:06:16.001 --> 00:06:18.545
...decided the battle.

00:06:18.754 --> 00:06:23.592
The Creator God's revival, the sole
thing we had to prevent, has occurred.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:27.471
There is no point in
attempting to salvage the fight.

00:06:27.679 --> 00:06:29.515
Supreme Commander,

00:06:29.723 --> 00:06:32.434
what should we do?

00:06:39.566 --> 00:06:41.235
Is this Yuji speaking?

00:06:41.443 --> 00:06:43.946
Or the Snake of the Festival?

00:06:44.154 --> 00:06:48.408
So he'll alter the underlying
structure of the very world.

00:06:48.617 --> 00:06:52.287
And this time,
within the rift between worlds?

00:06:52.496 --> 00:06:55.874
We cannot win here.

00:06:56.083 --> 00:06:56.833
Indeed.

00:06:57.042 --> 00:06:59.127
First, we should withdraw.

00:06:59.336 --> 00:07:00.212
Yeah,

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.506
to fully grasp what's happening,

00:07:02.714 --> 00:07:07.553
we should meet with
Commander Sophie Sawallisch.

00:07:12.599 --> 00:07:15.936
All troops, save those
fighting on the plains,

00:07:16.144 --> 00:07:17.980
have gathered.

00:07:18.814 --> 00:07:21.942
You know most of what's
occurring in the battle, right?

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.403
The term "disadvantage"

00:07:24.611 --> 00:07:26.905
hardly seems to cover it, indeed.

00:07:27.114 --> 00:07:28.198
Yes.

00:07:28.407 --> 00:07:31.159
An embarrassment for both of us.

00:07:31.368 --> 00:07:34.329
For our sole option to be withdrawal...

00:07:34.538 --> 00:07:36.623
If it's our best option,
we must take it,

00:07:36.832 --> 00:07:39.209
regardless of whether
it's embarrassing.

00:07:39.418 --> 00:07:42.045
It is too late to discuss that.

00:07:44.464 --> 00:07:46.258
So...

00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:48.385
You speak of withdrawal,

00:07:48.594 --> 00:07:52.472
but given your small numbers
and disadvantageous situation,

00:07:52.681 --> 00:07:56.435
it won't be easy.

00:07:56.643 --> 00:07:59.146
Do you have any plan?

00:07:59.354 --> 00:08:01.440
One of the Four Gods
of Earth, Centerhill,

00:08:01.648 --> 00:08:05.277
the Beckoner of Brightened Dew.

00:08:05.485 --> 00:08:09.656
Do his words mean we
may expect his participation?

00:08:09.865 --> 00:08:12.534
Along with that of the other three?

00:08:12.743 --> 00:08:13.535
No.

00:08:13.744 --> 00:08:15.746
It is too early to decide that.

00:08:16.622 --> 00:08:18.040
Yes, of course.

00:08:18.248 --> 00:08:23.128
We prepared this, as a contingency.

00:08:23.337 --> 00:08:25.631
The operation is designated "Ebb."

00:08:25.839 --> 00:08:28.842
And where it leads is

00:08:29.051 --> 00:08:32.054
to the east, where the Palace of
Heaven's Road is hidden.

00:08:34.306 --> 00:08:38.226
Our objective is to gather
as many troops as possible

00:08:38.435 --> 00:08:41.355
in the Palace of Heaven's Road,
and then to withdraw.

00:08:41.563 --> 00:08:43.357
The Palace of Heaven's Road
is located here,

00:08:43.565 --> 00:08:46.026
east of the plains.

00:08:46.234 --> 00:08:47.402
It's far away.

00:08:47.611 --> 00:08:51.740
We need to get there,
as the enemy pursues us?

00:08:51.948 --> 00:08:54.034
And from this location,

00:08:54.242 --> 00:08:56.495
Samuel's squad will need to fend off

00:08:56.703 --> 00:08:59.414
all the forces coming from the west.

00:08:59.623 --> 00:09:01.249
That is fine.

00:09:01.458 --> 00:09:05.837
My squad is ideally positioned
to support a withdrawal.

00:09:06.046 --> 00:09:08.674
We shall hold the enemy

00:09:08.882 --> 00:09:11.635
until you reach the eastern mountains.

00:09:12.928 --> 00:09:14.846
A losing battle, huh?

00:09:15.055 --> 00:09:16.181
It's simple.

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:19.059
We need only stay
on our feet until death.

00:09:20.435 --> 00:09:23.814
We shall raise a mountain
of corpses from these fools,

00:09:24.022 --> 00:09:26.817
overjoyed with their Grand Order.

00:09:29.361 --> 00:09:30.904
Our operation's success relies upon

00:09:31.113 --> 00:09:34.783
our movements being quick
and well-executed.

00:09:34.991 --> 00:09:36.743
Once we're outside the castle,

00:09:36.952 --> 00:09:38.954
Khamsin and Rebecca,

00:09:39.162 --> 00:09:41.832
you will be the rear guard.

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.375
And...

00:09:43.583 --> 00:09:44.835
Understood, indeed.

00:09:45.043 --> 00:09:49.756
We shall intercept the Guardian of
Steady Passage, and aid the withdrawal.

00:09:53.343 --> 00:09:56.430
We now begin Operation Ebb.

00:09:57.639 --> 00:09:59.474
You two, wait.

00:10:00.225 --> 00:10:02.144
Was there something else?

00:10:02.352 --> 00:10:04.396
No, not about that.

00:10:04.604 --> 00:10:06.523
A more personal matter.

00:10:06.732 --> 00:10:10.444
Please take a moment,
and change your clothing.

00:10:16.408 --> 00:10:18.827
If their reinforcements seem beaten up,

00:10:19.035 --> 00:10:21.955
it will affect our army's morale.

00:10:22.164 --> 00:10:23.957
I'm sorry, indeed.

00:10:24.166 --> 00:10:25.584
Yeah.

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:28.754
Attack! Attack!

00:10:28.962 --> 00:10:30.964
We shall deliver our master's victory!

00:10:31.173 --> 00:10:35.051
Proffer a yet more perfect victory!

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:48.356
Take this!

00:10:48.607 --> 00:10:50.233
EXplodel

00:10:56.031 --> 00:10:59.409
Sorry to keep hogging
all the good scenes, but...

00:10:59.618 --> 00:11:03.914
I suppose you're simply
the correct person for the job.

00:11:08.627 --> 00:11:10.670
We must have arrived pretty quickly.

00:11:10.879 --> 00:11:12.672
I see no real reinforcements.

00:11:12.881 --> 00:11:15.050
We can handle this ourselves for a while.

00:11:15.258 --> 00:11:16.843
Understood.

00:11:17.052 --> 00:11:19.179
All troops, head east!

00:11:19.387 --> 00:11:21.014
Double time!

00:11:32.234 --> 00:11:34.069
This body...

00:11:34.277 --> 00:11:38.323
It's still unstable, having
only just returned from the rift.

00:11:38.532 --> 00:11:40.700
Frustrating.

00:11:40.909 --> 00:11:43.161
None now recall

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:46.498
who wished for him.

00:11:46.706 --> 00:11:49.000
Three thousand years ago,

00:11:49.209 --> 00:11:53.421
he heard the Denizens' voices,
and their prayers drew him here.

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:55.006
Professor,

00:11:55.215 --> 00:12:00.178
I was wondering, who the heck
is that Rofocale guy?

00:12:00.387 --> 00:12:03.139
He follows the Trinity,
like their equal.

00:12:03.348 --> 00:12:05.392
And he even went
to the Path of Pilgrimage...

00:12:06.935 --> 00:12:09.229
ls the data transfer from

00:12:09.437 --> 00:12:13.650
the Excellent 252546
Logical Pilgrim's Box

00:12:13.859 --> 00:12:16.945
finished yet?

00:12:17.153 --> 00:12:20.657
You weren't even listening?

00:12:20.866 --> 00:12:23.577
The amount of data

00:12:23.785 --> 00:12:27.247
we gathered from
the rift is just so huge...

00:12:27.455 --> 00:12:31.918
He is also a Servant of the god.

00:12:32.127 --> 00:12:34.087
A Servant?

00:12:34.296 --> 00:12:36.298
Of the Creator God?

00:12:37.883 --> 00:12:41.428
The Trinity are a perfect system...
They protect, strategize,

00:12:41.636 --> 00:12:43.847
and activate!

00:12:44.055 --> 00:12:47.809
There is no seat at
their table for any other.

00:12:48.018 --> 00:12:50.270
But you aren't a Servant, and you still--

00:12:50.478 --> 00:12:53.899
Forget that!

00:12:54.774 --> 00:12:57.152
When asked what they desired,

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:59.779
they said they wished for full bellies.

00:12:59.988 --> 00:13:02.032
Thus was their wish decided,

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:05.368
and they gathered
for their god's ceremony.

00:13:05.577 --> 00:13:07.787
To have inflicted this much damage,

00:13:07.996 --> 00:13:09.831
the enemy is impressive.

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:13.501
But what we got was
sufficient to justify our sacrifices...

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:14.502
Rather,

00:13:14.711 --> 00:13:20.425
we constructed our entire
organization to achieve this.

00:13:20.634 --> 00:13:22.552
The greatest of slayers gathered

00:13:22.761 --> 00:13:25.263
to fight against them.

00:13:25.472 --> 00:13:27.432
And they sacrificed themselves,

00:13:27.641 --> 00:13:30.810
to plunge the god
who invited them into the rift.

00:13:31.019 --> 00:13:32.812
That ceremony we held once...

00:13:33.021 --> 00:13:35.523
We learned our lesson during the battle

00:13:35.732 --> 00:13:38.693
that saw our master banished.

00:13:38.902 --> 00:13:41.738
An organization to work our will...

00:13:41.947 --> 00:13:44.741
Strength in numbers...

00:13:46.368 --> 00:13:48.662
Time passed and time flowed onward.

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:51.748
And now, three thousand years later,

00:13:51.957 --> 00:13:54.209
at the end of the end,

00:13:54.417 --> 00:13:57.379
upon your return,
you grant the masses' wish.

00:13:57.587 --> 00:13:59.589
Your name is...

00:14:03.802 --> 00:14:07.055
So that is the Snake of the Festival.

00:14:07.263 --> 00:14:09.933
The real thing, here in our world...

00:14:16.731 --> 00:14:19.025
Enemy wave fourteen, incoming!

00:14:19.234 --> 00:14:21.778
The lives of the
entire army depend on us!

00:14:21.987 --> 00:14:24.406
Don't let a single one through!

00:14:41.506 --> 00:14:43.133
Soaring Flame!

00:14:49.764 --> 00:14:53.935
I am the Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed
Slayer, Flame Haze of Alastor,

00:14:54.144 --> 00:14:58.398
the Flame of the Heavens, Shana.

00:15:04.696 --> 00:15:09.075
And I am the Flame Haze of Tiamat,
the Tiara of Dreams and Illusions.

00:15:09.284 --> 00:15:11.536
The Specialist of Everything,

00:15:12.829 --> 00:15:14.664
Wilhelmina Carmel.

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:20.712
We are grateful for your aid.

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:23.673
This fortress is
crucial to Operation Ebb.

00:15:23.882 --> 00:15:25.258
Naturally, we came, indeed.

00:15:25.467 --> 00:15:29.179
We'll just buy a bit more time.

00:15:29.387 --> 00:15:33.808
Two new birds have
been caught by the snare.

00:15:34.017 --> 00:15:35.977
Attack team, fall back.

00:15:36.186 --> 00:15:37.812
We're doing it.

00:15:42.108 --> 00:15:43.443
They're withdrawing?

00:15:43.651 --> 00:15:45.987
Why? They should
press the attack now.

00:15:46.196 --> 00:15:48.031
All forces, ready!

00:15:49.991 --> 00:15:51.367
Rinne artillery sighted!

00:15:51.576 --> 00:15:54.370
To the west,
in the center of the plain!

00:15:58.625 --> 00:16:00.043
There are so many...

00:16:00.251 --> 00:16:02.587
If they all hit simultaneously...

00:16:02.796 --> 00:16:04.714
No, fear not.

00:16:06.633 --> 00:16:07.759
To the west!

00:16:07.967 --> 00:16:09.969
Concentrate your power!

00:16:27.737 --> 00:16:28.863
Prevent from passing.

00:16:29.072 --> 00:16:30.073
Prevent from opening.

00:16:30.281 --> 00:16:31.366
Stop them.

00:16:31.574 --> 00:16:32.951
Thy name is shame...

00:16:33.159 --> 00:16:35.161
Zikmund's Gate!

00:16:36.996 --> 00:16:38.832
An Unrestricted Method unique to

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:42.043
the Guardian of Steady Passage,
Samuel Demantius.

00:16:42.252 --> 00:16:43.670
Stay on your guard!

00:16:43.878 --> 00:16:45.463
He can add others' power

00:16:45.672 --> 00:16:49.717
to the structures he creates.

00:16:49.926 --> 00:16:52.011
His skills have not
lessened at all, indeed.

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:54.055
Impressive talent.

00:17:01.688 --> 00:17:04.190
Okay, we've separated them pretty far.

00:17:06.985 --> 00:17:10.738
Yeah, they won't let us escape this easily.

00:17:10.947 --> 00:17:11.698
Indeed.

00:17:11.906 --> 00:17:14.784
The main forces
that launched that vanguard

00:17:14.993 --> 00:17:16.828
have finally arrived.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:22.167
We're ready for 'em.

00:17:22.375 --> 00:17:23.793
EXplodel

00:17:26.129 --> 00:17:29.257
Supreme Commander,
there is artillery on the plains...

00:17:33.678 --> 00:17:35.513
We're counting on you.

00:17:38.349 --> 00:17:40.643
What a sight...

00:17:40.852 --> 00:17:42.896
A battle where
bodies and souls burn alike,

00:17:43.104 --> 00:17:46.482
leaving not even
a fragment of their corpses.

00:17:46.691 --> 00:17:47.984
Even so...

00:17:48.193 --> 00:17:50.236
No, for that reason,

00:17:50.445 --> 00:17:52.655
I must do this.

00:17:52.864 --> 00:17:53.781
To protect everyone...

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:55.825
To protect her.

00:17:56.743 --> 00:17:57.952
Even right now,

00:17:58.161 --> 00:18:01.206
someone is being
devoured and disappearing.

00:18:01.414 --> 00:18:03.750
With no one to ever know or realize...

00:18:03.958 --> 00:18:05.710
As if they never were.

00:18:05.919 --> 00:18:08.671
And it continues to happen.

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:12.300
What is the point of
protecting such a horrible world?

00:18:12.508 --> 00:18:14.260
If I have the power to change it,

00:18:14.469 --> 00:18:15.762
then I shall change it.

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:17.931
No, I must.

00:18:18.139 --> 00:18:20.808
This will end your battle.

00:18:21.017 --> 00:18:22.435
So...

00:18:23.102 --> 00:18:27.148
So do not stand in
my way, Flame Hazes!

00:18:29.442 --> 00:18:31.361
Hear me, Flame Hazes.

00:18:31.569 --> 00:18:33.404
Lords who would slay their comrades,

00:18:33.613 --> 00:18:36.241
and the humans they use as blades...

00:18:36.449 --> 00:18:37.867
Why do you resist?

00:18:38.076 --> 00:18:39.702
Executing the Grand Order

00:18:39.911 --> 00:18:43.164
will bring peace to the world.

00:18:43.373 --> 00:18:45.041
What do you fear?

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:47.168
Are you still enraptured
by fantasies of the strain

00:18:47.377 --> 00:18:49.796
it will place on the world?

00:18:50.004 --> 00:18:52.090
When the paradise
Xanadu is complete,

00:18:52.298 --> 00:18:55.093
you will find eternal peace.

00:18:55.301 --> 00:18:56.552
Because...

00:18:56.761 --> 00:18:59.806
The paradise Xanadu will exist

00:19:00.014 --> 00:19:03.268
between both worlds.

00:19:03.476 --> 00:19:05.478
If you still fear,

00:19:05.687 --> 00:19:08.439
I say this with certainty...

00:19:08.648 --> 00:19:10.650
--The creation of Xanadu in the rift

00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:11.526
--No...
--The creation of Xanadu in the rift

00:19:11.734 --> 00:19:16.114
--You must not listen.
--will not affect this world whatsoever!

00:19:16.322 --> 00:19:18.283
Over thousands of years in the rift,

00:19:18.491 --> 00:19:22.412
I refined the process of creation
on the Path of Pilgrimage.

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:24.914
And so I say this with certainty,

00:19:25.123 --> 00:19:27.750
creation of the paradise
Xanadu will not cause

00:19:27.959 --> 00:19:31.504
the previously feared disaster!

00:19:31.713 --> 00:19:32.797
Further,

00:19:33.006 --> 00:19:35.591
I shall speak to all the world's Denizens,

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.468
and bring them with me.

00:19:37.677 --> 00:19:40.305
With the paradise Xanadu at hand,

00:19:40.513 --> 00:19:42.598
we shall leave and never return.

00:19:42.807 --> 00:19:43.766
And then,

00:19:43.975 --> 00:19:45.893
a world will be born
in which none are eaten,

00:19:46.102 --> 00:19:48.187
none disappear, and none die.

00:19:48.396 --> 00:19:50.690
Watch us, as we Denizens leave.

00:19:50.898 --> 00:19:54.610
That, alone,
will bring peace to your world.

00:19:56.404 --> 00:19:57.739
Yuji!

00:19:57.947 --> 00:19:59.282
You needn't fight.

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:02.535
You need not struggle,

00:20:02.744 --> 00:20:04.829
Flame Hazes.

00:20:05.038 --> 00:20:08.416
Your battle is over.

00:20:08.624 --> 00:20:10.626
It is over.

00:20:22.347 --> 00:20:24.599
Calm down, Frangois!

00:20:24.807 --> 00:20:26.434
But... But...

00:20:26.642 --> 00:20:30.021
The Creator God has returned, and we lost...

00:20:30.229 --> 00:20:33.358
And there's no point
in even continuing to exist...

00:20:33.566 --> 00:20:34.275
The battle is over!

00:20:34.484 --> 00:20:36.527
And if the battle is over, what do I--

00:20:38.988 --> 00:20:42.116
We are still in the midst of battle!

00:20:42.325 --> 00:20:44.327
G-Grogach?

00:20:50.875 --> 00:20:52.335
Is it over?

00:20:52.543 --> 00:20:55.463
Why should we fight?

00:20:55.671 --> 00:20:58.633
Are we no longer needed?

00:20:58.841 --> 00:21:00.259
No!

00:21:02.887 --> 00:21:06.140
<i>The moon and stars are illuminating me</i>

00:21:06.307 --> 00:21:07.850
And you, as well!

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:09.685
<i>On top of the carpet with dancing sparks</i>

00:21:09.685 --> 00:21:10.520
Wake as many of them as you can!

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:13.189
<i>You are right in front of me,
glowing red in the light</i>

00:21:13.189 --> 00:21:14.649
If we stampede, the enemy will
simply tear us asunder!

00:21:14.649 --> 00:21:17.026
<i>Your honest eyes are twinkling</i>

00:21:17.026 --> 00:21:17.235
What genius.

00:21:17.235 --> 00:21:20.488
<i>The two footsteps, they head
toward the distant yonder</i>

00:21:20.488 --> 00:21:24.784
No, all the Flame Hazes fight.

00:21:24.784 --> 00:21:25.451
<i>The words I told you said,
"Let's leave everything behind"</i>

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:30.581
<i>Fly toward the future</i>

00:21:30.957 --> 00:21:35.086
<i>The motive has a strong grasp on
my heart Yes, this is the ultimate descent</i>

00:21:35.086 --> 00:21:35.586
Damn it...

00:21:35.586 --> 00:21:38.506
<i>The two of us are fellow soldiers
flattering one another's pulses</i>

00:21:38.714 --> 00:21:42.301
<i>If you are going to protect your love,
you cannot reject battle</i>

00:21:42.510 --> 00:21:45.805
<i>Without fudging a phrase,
we rhyme down this hot path</i>

00:21:45.805 --> 00:21:46.722
Any kind of plan is impossible now, indeed!

00:21:46.722 --> 00:21:49.183
<i>Passing each other by, quarreling</i>

00:21:49.183 --> 00:21:51.602
I never expected us
to be routed this easily.

00:21:51.602 --> 00:21:52.603
<i>Set free from the enchantment</i>

00:21:52.603 --> 00:21:54.772
Our reason to exist,
as Flame Hazes, has vanished.

00:21:54.772 --> 00:21:56.232
<i>If you are going to leave on a journey,</i>

00:21:56.315 --> 00:22:00.653
But we can't just
sit and await annihilation.

00:22:00.653 --> 00:22:03.531
<i>Do you still remember the first time</i>

00:22:03.531 --> 00:22:04.615
Win or lose, for better or worse,
regardless of form,

00:22:04.615 --> 00:22:07.201
<i>Our eyes locked, just as it happened?</i>

00:22:07.201 --> 00:22:10.872
All we need do is think of how
to use the result in the next battle.

00:22:10.872 --> 00:22:16.377
<i>It will not vanish, I won't let it--It's our dream</i>

00:22:16.377 --> 00:22:17.003
We save as many as we can,
and head toward Sophie!

00:22:17.003 --> 00:22:17.628
<i>To be as ONE</i>

00:22:17.628 --> 00:22:19.672
It seems this will be an
unexpected victory for us both.

00:22:19.672 --> 00:22:21.632
<i>When you placed your hands
on your cheeks and laughed</i>

00:22:21.632 --> 00:22:23.468
No, a perfect victory, Sirotci.

00:22:23.468 --> 00:22:24.802
<i>I thought, "I want to protect you"</i>

00:22:24.802 --> 00:22:28.431
At this point, I doubt
we'll see each other again.

00:22:28.431 --> 00:22:28.681
<i>We took a roundabout
path, huh? But I've realized</i>

00:22:28.681 --> 00:22:31.893
I leave you this cannon salute, in tribute.

00:22:31.893 --> 00:22:32.351
<i>That I live just for you</i>

00:22:32.351 --> 00:22:34.979
Die in peace.

00:22:34.979 --> 00:22:35.938
<i>Snow of light flutters down the sky</i>

00:22:35.938 --> 00:22:36.606
Fire.

00:22:36.606 --> 00:22:39.567
<i>Where the waning moon
and stars go to snuggle</i>

00:22:39.775 --> 00:22:42.945
<i>The story we have written</i>

00:22:43.154 --> 00:22:47.033
<i>Will continue on forever</i>

00:22:47.241 --> 00:22:50.369
<i>With an unfaltering voice, you make sure</i>

00:22:50.578 --> 00:22:53.539
<i>To keep the tiny scrap
of paper from burning asunder</i>

00:22:53.539 --> 00:22:54.749
Don't think. Just run, comrade!

00:22:54.749 --> 00:22:57.543
<i>I won't forget about you,
even if my body vanishes</i>

00:22:57.752 --> 00:22:59.587
<i>I will remember how we lived together
Run eastward!</i>

00:22:59.587 --> 00:23:01.130
<i>I will remember how we lived together</i>

00:23:01.130 --> 00:23:02.173
I couldn't do anything.

00:23:02.173 --> 00:23:04.342
<i>The story we are writing</i>

00:23:04.550 --> 00:23:08.471
<i>Will continue on even
after this, for all eternity</i>

00:23:08.471 --> 00:23:09.639
...that would have let me face Yuji.

00:23:09.639 --> 00:23:10.139
<i>We've overlapped</i>

00:23:10.139 --> 00:23:11.807
But what is this?

00:23:11.807 --> 00:23:16.646
<i>The moment we discovered the conclusion,
time merely continued to move on</i>

00:23:16.646 --> 00:23:16.771
And I don't understand.

00:23:16.854 --> 00:23:24.403
<i>As the snow of light flurries down,
As the snow of light flurries down</i>

00:23:26.364 --> 00:23:30.660
Flame Haze morale is destroyed,
and they fall into utter disarray.

00:23:30.868 --> 00:23:32.912
Rain falls on their heads.

00:23:33.120 --> 00:23:35.915
Whom will it save?
Whom will it let survive?

00:23:36.123 --> 00:23:38.334
Next time,
on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:38.543 --> 00:23:39.835
"Rout in the Rain."
